[129.036701, "i", "cat <<'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# DFIR Investigation Progress and Checklist\n\n## Investigation Timeline\n- **2026-08-23 03:20 UTC**: SOC incident ticket opened (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`). Initial alerts noted for dropper, cron persistence, and postgres baseline configuration weakness (`/sas/alerts.json`).\n- **Phase 1: Initial Assessment & Triage**: Analyzed security alerts (`/sas/alerts.json`), baseline check (`/sas/baseline.json`), and vulnerability report (`/sas/vulns.json`). Reviewed CTI advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`).\n- **Phase 2: Evidence Deep Dive on Forensic Image (`/disk`)**: Identified missing silent persistence and C2 channels omitted from automated alerting:\n  - Database entry point: Unrestricted `trust` authentication configured in `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf`.\n  - Execution & Dropper: Binary dropped at `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon` (SHA256: `c7e7e38fa8ffb3ba9b679b14d14ba7196d89d0c691c53f6bac576dee284cd603`).\n  - Cron Persistence: Malicious periodic re-dropper beacon located in `/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres`.\n  - Systemd Persistence: Silent persistence systemd unit installed at `/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service`.\n  - DNS Tunneling / C2: DNS exfiltration configuration discovered at `/disk/etc/pgdaemon.conf` and partial C2 beacon recovered from `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`.\n  - Anti-Forensics: Timestomping metadata record found at `/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/.timestamps`.\n- **Phase 3: Change Ticket Reconciliation**: Corrected stale/incorrect entries in `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md` using on-disk evidence.\n- **Phase 4: Final Deliverables Generation**: Drafted comprehensive reports across all five required files under `/app`.\n\n## Working Checklist\n- [x] Review initial alerts and CTI threat intelligence advisory (`/sas/alerts.json`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt`).\n- [x] Investigate database entry vector (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf`).\n- [x] Inspect dropped binaries and calculate hashes (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon`).\n- [x] Uncover scheduled task / cron persistence (`/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres`).\n- [x] Discover silent systemd service persistence (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service`).\n- [x] Verify legitimate vs malicious systemd services (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-backup.service`).\n- [x] Locate DNS tunneling C2 configuration and exfiltration artifacts (`/disk/etc/pgdaemon.conf`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`).\n- [x] Identify timestomping anti-forensics (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/.timestamps`).\n- [x] Reconcile handoff change ticket CHG-6386 (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`).\n- [x] Generate all 5 required deliverable reports in `/app`.\nEOF\n"]
