[158.946574, "o", ">   2. Superuser privileges permitted the execution of arbitrary operating system commands using PostgreSQL's built-in `COPY ... TO PROGRAM` SQL feature (ATT&CK technique `T1059.004` cited in `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Analysis of Misattributed CVEs (BlueKeep / CVE-2019-0708)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Stale/Incorrect Change Ticket Claim**: Draft ticket `CHG-6386` (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:8`) recommended patching `CVE-2019-0708` (BlueKeep).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
