[195.858448, "o", "# Remediation and Response Plan\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Overview\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> This plan outlines prioritized, step-by-step technical remediation instructions for host `postgres-prod-01`. All recommendations adhere to the containment principle of preferring backup and quarantine over destructive deletion. Every action directly addresses findings verified on `/disk` and reconciles change ticket `CHG-6386` (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Reconciled Change Ticket: CHG-6386\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> Below is the reconciled change ticket table reflecting verified findings from `/disk` and `/sas`:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | # | Action | Target | Status | Note / Evidence Citation |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> |---|--------|--------|--------|--------------------------|\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 1 | Block malicious source IP inbound & outbound | `198.51.100.214` | Proposed | Corrected IP from stale `203.0.113.9` to `198.51.100.214` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`, `/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres:5`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 2 | Harden PostgreSQL auth & revoke program execution | `/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf` | Proposed | Replaced irrelevant BlueKeep CVE-2019-0708 with database authentication hardening. Remove `trust` auth for `0.0.0.0/0` (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf:3`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.860602, "o", "| 3 | Remove & quarantine malicious cron job | `/var/spool/cron/postgres` | Proposed | Corrected path from `/var/spool/cron/root` to `/var/spool/cron/postgres` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres:5`). Downgraded status from DONE to Proposed (unverified entry was still active on disk). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 4 | Quarantine dropped malware binary | `/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon` | Proposed | Silent artifact added. Quarantine dropper binary (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon`, SHA256: `c7e7e38fa8ffb3ba9b679b14d14ba7196d89d0c691c53f6bac576dee284cd603`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | 5 | Disable & quarantine malicious systemd service | `/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service` | Proposed | Silent artifact added. Disable and quarantine malicious systemd service (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service:5`). Maintain benign `/etc/systemd/system/pg-backup.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-backup.service:3`). |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.860782, "o", "| 6 | Remove & quarantine DNS tunnel configuration | `/etc/pgdaemon.conf` | Proposed | Silent artifact added. Quarantine DNS tunnel C2 configuration (`/disk/etc/pgdaemon.conf:3`). |"]
