[195.863875, "o", "### Phase 2: Persistence Removal & Quarantine (High Priority)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.86389, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[195.86396, "o", "> "]
[195.864099, "o", "1. **Quarantine Dropper Binary & C2 Config**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.864393, "o", "   - Action: Create secure directory `/var/quarantine/` (mode 700) and move malware files (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon:1`, `/disk/etc/pgdaemon.conf:3`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
