[195.865406, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.865431, "o", "     ```\r\n"]
[195.865478, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.865711, "o", "   - Verification: `ls -la /var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon /etc/pgdaemon.conf` (confirm files no longer exist in original paths).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.865795, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.865869, "o", "2. **Disable Malicious Systemd Persistence Service**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.86626, "o", "   - Action: Stop, disable, and quarantine `/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service:5`). Do NOT touch `/etc/systemd/system/pg-backup.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-backup.service:3`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
