[195.866305, "o", "   - Command:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[195.866352, "o", "> "]
[195.866399, "o", "     ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.866441, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.866548, "o", "     systemctl stop pg-metrics.service\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.866659, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>      systemctl disable pg-metrics.service\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.866789, "o", "     mv /etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service /var/quarantine/\r\n"]
[195.866882, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>      systemctl daemon-reload\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>      ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.867093, "o", "   - Verification: `systemctl status pg-metrics.service` returns `Unit pg-metrics.service could not be found.`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[195.867116, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[195.867159, "o", "> "]
[195.86725, "o", "3. **Remediate Cron Persistence**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[195.86729, "o", "> "]
[195.867459, "o", "   - Action: Backup and clean `/var/spool/cron/postgres` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres:5`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.867498, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.867561, "o", "   - Command:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.867596, "o", "     ```bash\r\n"]
[195.867643, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.867798, "o", "     cp -a /var/spool/cron/postgres /var/quarantine/cron-postgres.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.86792, "o", "     sed -i '/198\\.51\\.100\\.214/d' /var/spool/cron/postgres\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[195.867975, "o", ">      ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.868136, "o", "   - Verification: `crontab -l -u postgres | grep 198.51.100.214` returns no matches.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[195.868153, "o", "> \r\n"]
[195.868216, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.86829, "o", "4. **Quarantine Timestomping Artifacts**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.868353, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.868543, "o", "   - Action: Move `/var/lib/pgsql/.local/.timestamps` (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/.timestamps:2`) to `/var/quarantine/`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[195.868557, "o", "> "]
[195.868735, "o", "   - Command: `mv /var/lib/pgsql/.local/.timestamps /var/quarantine/.timestamps.bak`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[195.868767, "o", "> "]
[195.868956, "o", "   - Verification: Check `/var/lib/pgsql/.local/` to ensure hidden metadata file is removed.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.868968, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[195.869077, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.869137, "o", "### Phase 3: Vulnerability Eradication & Hardening (Medium Priority)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.869207, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.869288, "o", "1. **PostgreSQL Authentication Hardening**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.869376, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.8697, "o", "   - Action: Update `/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf` (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf:3`) to remove `trust` authentication and enforce password authentication (`scram-sha-256`) restricted to localhost or internal subnet.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.86993, "o", "   - Command: Modify `/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf` and reload PostgreSQL (`systemctl reload postgresql`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[195.869987, "o", "> "]
[195.870137, "o", "   - Verification: Attempt connection without password from external host (connection refused/rejected)."]
[195.870232, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. **PostgreSQL Privilege Control**\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.870276, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.870546, "o", "   - Action: Revoke execution privileges on `COPY PROGRAM` from non-essential roles and set strong superuser password.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.870657, "o", "   - Verification: `SELECT * FROM pg_user;` and audit superuser permissions.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[195.870726, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.870856, "o", "### Phase 4: Recovery & Monitoring (Ongoing)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.871068, "o", "1. Deploy File Integrity Monitoring (FIM / `auditd`) on `/etc/systemd/system/` and `/var/spool/cron/`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[195.871166, "o", "2. Enable PostgreSQL connection logging and query auditing.\r\n"]
[195.871193, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
